N-0X6Q&oe=6A1B066E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Star Defender", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Star Defender\n\n**Overview:**  \nIn *Star Defender*, your mission is to safeguard the World Crystal in a serene, engaging idle defense game. Strategically position your defensive gadgets to fend off continuous waves of enemies and keep the crystal intact. With its intuitive gameplay and uncomplicated mechanics, *Star Defender* offers a peaceful retreat\u2014ideal for both brief play sessions and extended gaming marathons. Enjoy straightforward fun without any in-app purchases or disruptive ads.\n\nFocusing solely on defense strategy, *Star Defender* eliminates the need for complex upgrades or resource juggling. Simply plan your defense, watch your devices in action, and relish the satisfaction of protecting the crystal. Whether you're a casual gamer or a seasoned strategist, the accessible design ensures a gratifying experience for players of all backgrounds.\n\n**Highlights:**  \n- \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **Simple Defense Mechanics:** Deploy devices to shield the World Crystal from incoming threats.  \n- \ud83c\udf1f **Relaxing and User-Friendly:** Easy-to-grasp gameplay for a calm, stress-free experience.  \n- \ud83d\udeab **Ad-Free Experience:** Enjoy the complete game with no in-app purchases or intrusive ads.  \n- \ud83c\udf0c **Perfect for Idle Play:** Engage at your own pace with minimal interaction required.  \n\nExperience the tranquil challenge of defending the World Crystal in *Star Defender*\u2014a harmonious blend of strategy and relaxation for every player.", "short_description": "**Highlights:**  \n- \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **Simple Defense Mechanics:** Deploy devices to shield the World Crystal from incoming threats.  \n- \ud83c\udf1f **Relaxing and User-Friendly:** Easy-to-grasp gameplay for a calm, stress-free experience.  \n- \ud83d\udeab **Ad-Free Experience:** Enjoy the complete game with no in-app purchases or intrusive ads.  \n- \ud83c\udf0c **Perfect for Idle Play:** Engage at your own pace with minimal interaction required.  "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sd.codecola.uk/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "minggu studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sd.codecola.uk/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9080203488759979"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392114_1976471039527983_2305534605635432702_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dbMi0Lj4WIEQ7kNvwFhJ2qL&_nc_oc=AdrLY-1CP4CC_vNUV7EmmunHve1XUH4cl22-9kyTIN3cdy4DGaoxyk9Jgk0Vt8q6VoM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Mg1kK0HAXVX32yVgbsNRGinrOeLhhjJAt2sYxRGwg6A&oe=6A1AF23F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Star Defender", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Sandbox", "id": "1990104051447093"}], "release_date": 1738908300, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "8937868512993478", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "